    "northStar": "Architect Studio",
    "overview": "Engineering work is presented through spacious typography, cool paper surfaces, cobalt stages, and open geometric constructions. The user approved all three compositions: Bold (A), Bright (B), and Spatial (C). They share content and a visual language while changing its arrangement.\n\nThis document records the implemented studio system in `src/index.css`, `src/theme/themeConfig.ts`, and the studio components. The default Sunrise theme now uses the studio palette. Woodland and Ocean remain selectable alternatives; fixed studio artwork colors retain their own palette.",
